                                                "sense_id": "0459f8ef-f49b-309a-b2c6-6e88097ee011",
                                                "text": "The wise queen, however she might seem to have a fair opportunity offered to her suit, finds it not good to apprehend it too suddenly; as desiring by this small dilation to prepare the ear and heart of the king for so important a request"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
